#   modules/ii/sidebarLeft/widgets/{WidgetCard,WidgetsPage,MediaWidget,
#   WeatherWidget,NewsWidget,ResourcesWidget}.qml. Three upstream files were
#   edited and MUST be reapplied by hand on refetch:
#   modules/ii/sidebarLeft/SidebarLeftContent.qml (new "Widgets" tab entry,
#   gated on Config.options.sidebar.widgets.enable, prepended to
