#   services/Weather.qml (daily forecast fields: Weather.forecast, plus
#   temperature_2m_max/min/weather_code added to the existing daily= param).
#
# - Native Hyprland wallpaper sync (2026-09-02): scripts/colors/switchwall.sh's
#   switch(), static-image branch, gained three `hyprctl hyprpaper` calls
#   (preload/wallpaper/unload unused) right after set_wallpaper_path, so
